      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/contents/docs%2Fapi-guide%2Fcore%2Ffusions.md?ref=3f0439a6bcbbe3cf31df044b983fedcfd45caf03",
      "deletions": 2,
      "filename": "docs/api-guide/core/fusions.md",
      "patch": "@@ -12,9 +12,9 @@\n This package provides modules that provide commonly fused\n operations. Fusing operations improves compute efficiency by\n increasing the amount of work done each time a tensor is read from\n-memory. To perform the fusion, modules in this either rely on PyTorch\n+memory. To perform the fusion, modules in this package either rely on PyTorch\n functionality for doing just-in-time compilation\n-(i.e. `torch.jit.script` in older PyTorch versions of `torch.compile`\n+(i.e. `torch.jit.script` in older PyTorch versions or `torch.compile`\n in recent versions), or call into custom kernels in external libraries\n such as Apex or TransformerEngine.\n ",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/raw/3f0439a6bcbbe3cf31df044b983fedcfd45caf03/docs%2Fapi-guide%2Fcore%2Ffusions.md",
